<view class="page notice-import-page">
  <view class="card intro-card">
    <view class="section-title">从通知截图生成草稿</view>
    <view class="muted intro-text">一次选择 1–3 张清晰截图。AI 只提取学校或老师发布的通知，核对后可批量保存，也可进入单条通知补充提醒等高级设置。</view>
    <view class="privacy-note">截图仅用于本次识别，正常识别或取消后立即删除；异常情况下由云存储短期生命周期规则兜底删除，不保存为通知附件。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{blockedReason}}" class="blocked-note">{{blockedReason}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{enabled}}">
    <view class="row between">
      <view>
        <view class="section-title compact-title">选择截图</view>
        <view class="muted">仅支持 JPEG、PNG，单张不超过 4 MB</view>
      </view>
      <button class="ghost-button select-button" disabled="{{processing}}" bindtap="chooseScreenshots">{{selectedFiles.length ? '重新选择' : '选择截图'}}</button>
    </view>
    <view class="capture-guide">建议裁掉聊天列表、输入框和无关区域，保留通知正文、来源及时间。一整份通知请保留完整上下文；互不相关的多份通知尽量分图识别。</view>
    <view class="preview-grid" wx:if="{{selectedFiles.length}}">
      <view class="preview-item" wx:for="{{selectedFiles}}" wx:key="tempFilePath"><image src="{{item.tempFilePath}}" mode="aspectFill" /><text>{{index + 1}}</text></view>
    </view>
    <button class="primary-button recognize-button" loading="{{processing}}" disabled="{{processing || !selectedFiles.length}}" bindtap="recognize">开始识别</button>
    <view class="progress-text" wx:if="{{progressText}}">{{progressText}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="warning-card" wx:if="{{warnings.length}}">
    <view class="warning-title">识别提示</view>
    <view class="warning-item" wx:for="{{warnings}}" wx:key="*this">• {{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card mode-card" wx:if="{{modeSelectionVisible}}">
    <view class="section-title compact-title">通知保存方式</view>
    <view class="mode-help">识别到多段内容。若 1、2、3 是同一份通知里的多项要求，请整合为一条；只有内容互不相关时才保留为多条。</view>
    <view class="mode-options">
      <button class="mode-option {{draftMode === 'single' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="single" disabled="{{modeLocked || processing}}" bindtap="selectDraftMode">
        <text class="mode-title">整合为一条</text><text class="mode-note">保留分项要求</text>
      </button>
      <button class="mode-option {{draftMode === 'separate' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="separate" disabled="{{modeLocked || processing}}" bindtap="selectDraftMode">
        <text class="mode-title">保留多条</text><text class="mode-note">分别管理状态</text>
      </button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{modeLocked}}" class="mode-locked-note">已有通知保存，当前保存方式已锁定，避免重复创建。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card batch-card" wx:if="{{drafts.length}}">
    <view><view class="section-title compact-title">核对并保存</view><view class="muted">批量保存默认不启用提醒；需要提醒、事项时间或截止时间时，请进入单条高级设置。</view></view>
    <button class="primary-button batch-save-button" loading="{{phase === 'saving'}}" disabled="{{processing || !unsavedCount}}" bindtap="saveAllDrafts">{{unsavedCount ? '批量保存 ' + unsavedCount + ' 条通知' : '已全部保存'}}</button>
  </view>

  <view class="draft-card {{item.saved ? 'saved' : ''}}" wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:for-index="draftIndex" wx:key="localId">
    <view class="draft-header"><text>通知 {{draftIndex + 1}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.saved}}" class="saved-badge">✓ 已保存</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.uncertainFields.length}}" class="uncertain-note">黄色字段存在不确定内容，请人工核对。</view>
    <view class="field {{item.titleUncertain ? 'uncertain-field' : ''}}"><text class="field-label">标题 *</text><input class="input" maxlength="80" value="{{item.title}}" data-index="{{draftIndex}}" data-field="title" bindinput="onDraftInput" disabled="{{item.saved || processing}}" /></view>
    <view class="field {{item.sourceUncertain ? 'uncertain-field' : ''}}"><text class="field-label">来源</text><input class="input" maxlength="60" value="{{item.source}}" data-index="{{draftIndex}}" data-field="source" bindinput="onDraftInput" placeholder="例如：班主任-王老师" disabled="{{item.saved || processing}}" /></view>
    <view class="field {{item.categoryUncertain ? 'uncertain-field' : ''}}"><text class="field-label">分类</text><view class="tag-group"><text wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:for-item="categoryItem" wx:key="value" class="tag {{item.category === categoryItem.value ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="{{draftIndex}}" data-value="{{categoryItem.value}}" bindtap="selectCategory">{{categoryItem.label}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="field {{item.contentUncertain ? 'uncertain-field' : ''}}"><text class="field-label">内容</text><textarea class="textarea" maxlength="3000" value="{{item.content}}" data-index="{{draftIndex}}" data-field="content" bindinput="onDraftInput" disabled="{{item.saved || processing}}" /></view>
    <view class="time-suggestion {{item.eventTimeUncertain ? 'uncertain-field' : ''}}" wx:if="{{item.suggestedRemindTimeText || item.eventTimeUncertain}}">
      <text class="field-label">AI 时间建议</text>
      <view wx:if="{{item.suggestedRemindTimeText}}" class="suggested-time">{{item.suggestedRemindTimeText}}</view>
      <view wx:else class="muted">时间信息不完整，请在通知表单中手动设置。</view>
      <view class="time-help">此处只显示建议，不会自动启用提醒。</view>
    </view>
    <button class="ghost-button edit-button" disabled="{{item.saved || processing}}" bindtap="editDraft" data-index="{{draftIndex}}">{{item.saved ? '已保存' : '高级设置与单独保存'}}</button>
  </view>
</view>
